# This repo is developed on Windows and deployed to Linux. A CRLF in a shebang
# makes the kernel look for an interpreter literally named "bash\r", and a CRLF
# in a systemd unit breaks ExecStart. Force LF on everything that Linux executes
# or parses — it has already caused two deploy failures.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.service   text eol=lf
*.timer     text eol=lf
*.conf      text eol=lf
Makefile    text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
